      0.253,
      0.641,
      0.294
    ],
    "angle": 0,
    "content": "当 \\(x > 0\\) 时， \\(f(x) = \\lim_{n\\to \\infty}\\frac{1}{n}\\sum_{i = 0}^{n - 1}\\cos \\frac{x}{n} i = \\lim_{n\\to \\infty}\\frac{1}{x}\\sum_{i = 0}^{n - 1}\\cos \\frac{x}{n} i\\cdot \\frac{x}{n}\\)",
    "merge_prev": false
  },
  {
